# A small suite: three checks that should pass, one that deliberately fails.
# Run them all with "Local API Check: Run All Checks in File".

### Todo exists
GET {{base_url}}/todos/{{todo_id}}
Accept: application/json

expect:
  status: 200
  json_has: ["id", "title", "completed"]

### Users list is an array of objects
GET {{base_url}}/users
Accept: application/json

expect:
  status: 200
  json_has: ["0.id", "0.email"]

### Create a post
POST {{base_url}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "regression check",
  "userId": 1
}

expect:
  status: 201
  json_has: ["id"]

### Missing todo (deliberately failing example)
GET {{base_url}}/todos/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

expect:
  status: 200
  json_has: ["id"]
